    "description": "3 WhatsApp tricks most people never discover 👇\n\n1️⃣ Format your texts\nWrap words in symbols: *bold*, _italic_, ~strikethrough~ and ```monospace```. Works in any chat, no extra app needed.\n\n2️⃣ Message yourself\nSearch your own name (or tap your number) to open a private chat with yourself. Use it as a notepad for Wi-Fi passwords, grocery lists and links to read later. It syncs on every device.\n\n3️⃣ Pin your top chats\nLong-press a chat and tap the pin icon. Up to 3 chats stay at the top of your list, always.\n\n💬 Which trick was new to you? Comment 1, 2 or 3!\n\n🔔 Subscribe for quick app tutorials every week.\n\n🌐 More tips and AI prompts: https://keepmesignedin.com\n\n#whatsapp #whatsapptricks #techtips #whatsapptips #shorts",
